name: Whimsy Dicetricks 3
author: for pi and Lola — the ante-3 version. Perkeo by ante 3, Showman 1-3 so Oops can stack, Negative skip-tag ladder, stacked Oops/copy core, lucky ladders.
description: >
  Ante-3 cut of Whimsy Dicetricks. Perkeo from early packs by ante 3; Showman
  antes 1-3 so the Oops can stack; Negative small-blind Tag from ante 3 on;
  Oops! All 6s in the shop as a must from ante 3. Should: stacked Oops at antes
  4 and 5, and the lucky hit-stream ladders (money + mult, 8 to 1).
deck: Anaglyph
stake: White

must:
  - legendaryJoker: Perkeo
    antes: [3]
  - smallBlindTag: NegativeTag
    antes: [3,4,5,6,7,8]
    min: 2
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [3,4,5,6,7,8]
    sources:
      shopItems: [2,3,4,5,6,7,8]
  - joker: Showman
    antes: [1,2,3]
should:
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [4]
    sources:
      shopItems: [2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]
    score: 100
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [5]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0]
    score: 100
  - joker: OopsAll6s
    antes: [6]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0,1,2]
    score: 100
  - luckyMoney: [0]
    score: 28
  - luckyMoney: [1]
    score: 27
  - luckyMoney: [2]
    score: 26
  - luckyMoney: [3]
    score: 25
  - luckyMoney: [4]
    score: 24
  - luckyMoney: [5]
    score: 23
  - luckyMoney: [6]
    score: 22
  - luckyMoney: [7]
    score: 21
  - luckyMult: [0]
    score: 8
  - luckyMult: [1]
    score: 7
  - luckyMult: [2]
    score: 6
  - luckyMult: [3]
    score: 5
  - luckyMult: [4]
    score: 4
  - luckyMult: [5]
    score: 3
  - luckyMult: [6]
    score: 2
  - luckyMult: [7]
    score: 1

seeds:
  - D3A1OPUS
  - 2D4WOPUS
